  "title": "Liver Dumplings",
  "description": "This was my dad&#39;s way of making sure we got our weekly dose of liver. Most of the time he added it to soup, but once in a while he ladled it over noodles and fried onions. Ground liver is mixed with seasoned bread crumbs, and dropped into boiling broth.",
